    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458931742834689
    m_Localized: Takes 1 damage at the start of each of its turns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458932103544832
    m_Localized: Venom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458932103544833
    m_Localized: Takes 1 damage plus 5% of its max HP at the start of its turn and deals 6% less damage, for each stack (up to 5 stacks).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
