  - m_Id: 458952731131905
    m_Localized: Your skills poison every enemy they hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123292607881217
    m_Localized: Enemies you push or pull leave fire on the cells they leave behind, for 2 rounds.
    m_Metadata:
