      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123291198595073
    m_Localized: When a strike aimed at you misses, the enemy that struck becomes Exposed (takes 1 more damage from every hit) until the end of its next turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123291198595072
    m_Localized: Counterstrike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123291039211521
    m_Localized: When a strike aimed at you misses, the enemy that struck becomes Exposed (takes 1 more damage from every hit) until the end of its next turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123291039211520
    m_Localized: Counterstrike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123291529945089
    m_Localized: When an enemy you push or pull slams into another character, that one is pushed 1 cell too, in the same direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123291529945088
    m_Localized: Domino
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123291370561537
    m_Localized: 'Unlocks Stomp: hit everyone around you and push them 1 cell away.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123291370561536
    m_Localized: Heavy Step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123292280725505
    m_Localized: Frozen or chilled enemies you push slide until they hit something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123292280725504
    m_Localized: Slippery Ice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123291685134337
    m_Localized: When an enemy you push or pull slams into another character, that one is pushed 1 cell too, in the same direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123291685134336
    m_Localized: Domino
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123290875633665
    m_Localized: Killing an enemy gives you an extra walk this turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123290875633664
