  - m_Id: 5123292951814146
    m_Localized: Blinded
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123292951814145
    m_Localized: Cannot walk or use skills. A prepared strike is cancelled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123292951814144
    m_Localized: Frozen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2743378687893504
    m_Localized: Frontline brawler with the most HP. Shoves enemies out of position, into each other and into walls, and stuns the ones about to strike.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2743378734030848
    m_Localized: 'Controls the battlefield from afar: freezes enemies to cancel their strikes, sets the ground on fire and blows foes around. Has little HP.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2743378734030849
    m_Localized: 'Slippery assassin: poisons from afar, hooks enemies into danger and trades places to turn their strikes against them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4946699310063616
    m_Localized: Hammer Slam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4946699347812352
    m_Localized: 'Raises the hammer and marks the cells around him. On his next turn he smashes them: 3 damage to everyone on them, his guards too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4946699561721856
    m_Localized: Marked area
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4946699561721857
    m_Localized: 'This enemy is preparing a strike: on its next turn it hits the marked cells and whoever stands on them, other enemies included. Step out, push it so the strike turns with it, push another enemy in, or stun it to cancel. The numbers show the order the enemies act in.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032682152599552
    m_Localized: Webbed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032682282622976
    m_Localized: Cannot walk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032682580418560
    m_Localized: Fire Rain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032682580418561
    m_Localized: 'Lobs fire bombs: marks a 3x3 area 2 to 4 cells away (over obstacles) and hits everyone in it on its next turn for 1 damage and Burning.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032682874019840
    m_Localized: Crushing Blow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032682874019841
    m_Localized: 'Raises the club and marks a line of 3 cells in front of him. On his next turn he smashes it: 3 damage to everyone in it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032683163426816
    m_Localized: Web
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032683163426817
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cell 2 to 4 cells away in a straight line and webs it on its next turn: 1 damage, and whoever is there cannot walk on their next turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032683788378112
    m_Localized: Goblin Bomber
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032683788378113
    m_Localized: 'Keeps his distance and lobs fire bombs over obstacles: he marks a 3x3 area and hits it on his next turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032684375580672
    m_Localized: Ogre Brute
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032684375580673
    m_Localized: 'Elite. Slow and tough: winds up a crushing blow on a line in front of him. Step aside, or turn him toward his allies.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032684946006016
    m_Localized: Weaver Spider
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5032684946006017
    m_Localized: Quick and fragile. Webs a cell from afar so you cannot walk on your next turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123252296425472
    m_Localized: Ice Wall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123252422254592
    m_Localized: 'A wall of ice: nobody can stand on it or cross it, and it stops strikes and sight. It melts after a few rounds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123252854267904
    m_Localized: Cleave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123252854267905
    m_Localized: Hit the cell in front of you and the cells on both sides of it, pushing each enemy 1 cell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123253017845760
    m_Localized: Heavy Blow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123253017845761
    m_Localized: 'A slower, heavier hit: 2 damage and pushes the enemy 2 cells.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123253181423616
    m_Localized: Long Charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123253181423617
    m_Localized: Charge up to 5 cells in a straight line and push the enemy at the end 1 cell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123253336612864
    m_Localized: Crushing Charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123253336612865
    m_Localized: Charge up to 3 cells in a straight line and send the enemy at the end flying 2 cells.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123253508579328
    m_Localized: Resounding Bash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123253508579329
    m_Localized: 'Slam an adjacent enemy: 2 damage, push it 3 cells and stun it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123253672157184
    m_Localized: Shield Sweep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123253672157185
    m_Localized: 'Sweep the cell in front of you and both sides: 2 damage, push 2 cells and stun every enemy hit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123253835735040
    m_Localized: Stomp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123253835735041
    m_Localized: 'Stomp the ground: 1 damage to everyone around you and push them 1 cell away.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123253999312896
    m_Localized: Thunder Stomp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123253999312897
    m_Localized: 'Stomp the ground: 1 damage, push everyone around you 1 cell and stun them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123254171279360
    m_Localized: Heavy Stomp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123254171279361
    m_Localized: 'Stomp the ground: 1 damage to everyone around you and push them 2 cells away.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123254326468608
    m_Localized: Shield Throw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123254326468609
    m_Localized: 'Throw your shield at an enemy 2 to 4 cells away in a straight line: 1 damage and push it 1 cell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123254481657856
    m_Localized: Stunning Throw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123254481657857
    m_Localized: 'Throw your shield: 1 damage, push 1 cell and stun the enemy, cancelling its prepared strike.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123254641041408
    m_Localized: Heavy Throw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123254641041409
    m_Localized: 'Throw your shield hard: 1 damage and push the enemy 2 cells.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123254800424960
    m_Localized: Quake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123254800424961
    m_Localized: 'Split the ground in a line of 3 cells in front of you: 1 damage to everyone on it and push them 1 cell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123254959808512
    m_Localized: Long Fissure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123254959808513
    m_Localized: 'The crack runs 5 cells: 1 damage to everyone on it and push them 1 cell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123255110803456
    m_Localized: Deep Quake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123255110803457
    m_Localized: 'Split the ground in a line of 3 cells: 2 damage to everyone on it and push them 1 cell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123255437959168
    m_Localized: Strong Gust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123255437959169
    m_Localized: 'A stronger blast: 1 damage and pushes the target 2 cells away from you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123255597342720
    m_Localized: Gale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123255597342721
    m_Localized: 'A wide blast: hits the target cell and both sides of it, pushing each one 1 cell away from you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123255760920576
    m_Localized: Ice Prison
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123255760920577
    m_Localized: 'Freeze one character up to 3 cells away: 1 damage, and it cannot walk or use skills on its next turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123255916109824
    m_Localized: Deep Freeze
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123255916109825
    m_Localized: 'Freeze everyone around you: 2 damage, and on their next turn they cannot walk or use skills.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123256083881984
    m_Localized: Explosive Fireball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123256083881985
    m_Localized: 'The fireball bursts in a cross: 1 damage to each of the 5 cells, and all of them burn for 2 rounds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123256243265536
    m_Localized: Lobbed Fireball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123256243265537
    m_Localized: 'Lob the fireball over obstacles, 2 to 4 cells away: 2 damage, and the cell burns for 2 rounds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123256419426304
    m_Localized: Wide Storm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123256419426305
    m_Localized: 'The storm covers a 3x3 area: 1 damage and stuns everyone in it. Channelled: it also spends the walk of the turn (use it before walking).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123256608169984
    m_Localized: Quick Storm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123256608169985
    m_Localized: 'The same storm, ready again sooner (cooldown 3). Channelled: it also spends the walk of the turn (use it before walking).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123256780136448
    m_Localized: Ice Wall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123256780136449
    m_Localized: Raise a wall of ice 3 cells wide, up to 3 cells away, for 2 rounds. It blocks walking, sight and strikes. Enemies where it rises take 1 damage and are chilled (walk 1 less) instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123256939520000
    m_Localized: Long Wall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123256939520001
    m_Localized: The wall is 5 cells wide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123257107292160
    m_Localized: Lasting Wall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123257107292161
    m_Localized: The wall lasts 4 rounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123257270870016
    m_Localized: Meteor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123257270870017
    m_Localized: 'Call a meteor on a 3x3 area 2 to 4 cells away (no line of sight needed): 2 damage, and everyone around the center is pushed 1 cell away from it. Channelled: it also spends the walk of the turn (use it before walking), and you cannot walk on your next turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123257430253568
    m_Localized: Burning Meteor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123257430253569
    m_Localized: 'The meteor also leaves the center cell burning for 2 rounds. Channelled: it also spends the walk of the turn (use it before walking), and you cannot walk on your next turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123257581248512
    m_Localized: Swift Meteor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123257581248513
    m_Localized: 'The same meteor, ready again sooner (cooldown 4). Channelled: it also spends the walk of the turn (use it before walking), and you cannot walk on your next turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123257904209920
    m_Localized: Piercing Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123257904209921
    m_Localized: 'The dagger goes through: it hits the target and the cell behind it, poisoning both.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123258063593472
    m_Localized: Crippling Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123258063593473
    m_Localized: '1 damage and Weakened instead of poison: the target deals 1 less damage on its next turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123258235559936
    m_Localized: Long Hook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123258235559937
    m_Localized: The hook reaches 2 to 5 cells away and pulls up to 4 cells.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123258390749184
    m_Localized: Stunning Hook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123258390749185
    m_Localized: Pull the enemy up to 3 cells and stun it, cancelling its prepared strike.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123258550132736
    m_Localized: Shadow Step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123258550132737
    m_Localized: Trade places with a character up to 3 cells away; an enemy takes 1 damage. An enemy's prepared strike moves with it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123258709516288
    m_Localized: Venom Step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123258709516289
    m_Localized: Trade places with a character; an enemy takes 1 damage and is Poisoned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123258873094144
    m_Localized: Long Step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123258873094145
    m_Localized: Trade places with a character up to 5 cells away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123259032477696
    m_Localized: Fan of Knives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123259032477697
    m_Localized: 'Three daggers: hit the target and both sides of it, exposing each enemy hit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123259191861248
    m_Localized: Quick Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123259191861249
    m_Localized: 'No cooldown: throw one every turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123259351244800
    m_Localized: Thrown Smoke
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123259351244801
    m_Localized: 'Throw the smoke bomb up to 3 cells away: it blinds everyone in a 3x3 area.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123259510628352
    m_Localized: Dense Smoke
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123259510628353
    m_Localized: 'The smoke lingers: enemies stay blinded for 2 of their turns.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123259665817600
    m_Localized: Long Poison Line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123259665817601
    m_Localized: The line is 6 cells long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123259829395456
    m_Localized: Concentrated Poison
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123259829395457
    m_Localized: 2 damage to everyone on the line, Poisoned, and a poison bog for 2 rounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123259992973312
    m_Localized: Club Swing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123259992973313
    m_Localized: 'Marks a row of 3 cells in front of it and smashes them on its next turn: 1 damage to whoever stands there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123260152356864
    m_Localized: Bite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123260152356865
    m_Localized: 'Marks an adjacent cell and the one behind it, and bites there on its next turn: 1 damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123260307546112
    m_Localized: Acid Splash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123260307546113
    m_Localized: 'Marks the cell in front of it and both sides, and splashes them on its next turn: 1 damage to each.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123260471123968
    m_Localized: Flame Bolt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123260471123969
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cross of 5 cells 2 to 3 cells away in a straight line and shoots it on its next turn: 1 damage and Burning for 2 turns.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123260626313216
    m_Localized: Dive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123260626313217
    m_Localized: 'Marks a diagonal neighbour cell and the one behind it, and dives there on its next turn: 1 damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123260798279680
    m_Localized: Spark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123260802473984
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cross of 5 cells 2 to 3 cells away and zaps it on its next turn: 1 damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123260961857536
    m_Localized: Screech
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123260961857537
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cross of 5 cells up to 2 cells away and screeches at it on its next turn: 1 damage and pushes 1 cell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123261129629696
    m_Localized: Hex Gaze
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123261129629697
    m_Localized: 'Marks 2 cells in a row, 2 to 4 cells away in a straight line, and curses them on its next turn: 1 damage and Exposed (takes 1 more damage from every hit).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123261301596160
    m_Localized: Shield Shove
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123261301596161
    m_Localized: 'Marks an adjacent cell and the one behind it, and shoves there on its next turn: 1 damage and pushes 1 cell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123261486145536
    m_Localized: Spear Thrust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123261486145537
    m_Localized: 'Marks 2 cells in a line in front of it and thrusts on its next turn: 1 damage to each.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123261649723392
    m_Localized: Ram
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123261649723393
    m_Localized: 'Marks an adjacent cell and the one behind it, and rams there on its next turn: 1 damage and pushes 2 cells.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123261809106944
    m_Localized: Mortar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123261809106945
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cross of cells 2 to 5 cells away (over obstacles) and shells it on its next turn: 1 damage to each.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123262002044928
    m_Localized: Lightning Bolt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123262002044929
    m_Localized: 'Marks a line of 5 cells and strikes it on its next turn: 1 damage to everyone on it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123262165622784
    m_Localized: Tremor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123262165622785
    m_Localized: 'Marks every cell around it and pounds the ground on its next turn: 2 damage to each.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123262325006336
    m_Localized: Bog Curse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123262325006337
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cross of cells 2 to 4 cells away and curses it on its next turn: 1 damage, and the cells become a poison bog for 2 rounds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123262484389888
    m_Localized: Vampire Bite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123262484389889
    m_Localized: 'Marks an adjacent cell and the one behind it, and bites there on its next turn: 1 damage, and the bat heals 1 HP.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123262643773440
    m_Localized: Wind Gust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123262643773441
    m_Localized: 'Marks a line of 3 cells in front of it and blows on its next turn: 1 damage and pushes everyone on it 1 cell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123262803156992
    m_Localized: Bone Sweep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123262803156993
    m_Localized: 'Marks the cell in front of it and both sides and sweeps them on its next turn: 2 damage to each.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123262954151936
    m_Localized: Dark Charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123262954151937
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cell 2 to 4 cells away in a straight line and charges it on its next turn: 2 damage and pushes 1 cell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123263117729792
    m_Localized: Eruption
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123263117729793
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cross of cells up to 3 cells away and erupts on its next turn: 2 damage, and the cells burn for 2 rounds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123264095002624
    m_Localized: Goblin Lancer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123264095002625
    m_Localized: 'Thrusts its spear through 2 cells in a line: whoever stands behind you gets hit too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123264250191872
    m_Localized: Ram Beetle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123264250191873
    m_Localized: 'Rams an adjacent cell and throws you 2 cells: watch what is behind you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123264417964032
    m_Localized: Goblin Artillerist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123264417964033
    m_Localized: Shells a cross of cells from far away, over obstacles, and slings stones while it reloads. Fragile up close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123264577347584
    m_Localized: Lightning Totem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123264577347585
    m_Localized: Never walks. Strikes a line of 5 cells and, while it recharges, shocks every cell around it; push it to aim the bolt at its allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123264740925440
    m_Localized: Stone Golem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123264740925441
    m_Localized: Armored and slow. Pounds every cell around it for 2 damage and, while it recovers, punches and pushes you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123264904503296
    m_Localized: Swamp Witch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123264904503297
    m_Localized: Curses a cross of cells and turns them into a poison bog, shrinking the safe ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123265059692544
    m_Localized: Vampire Bat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123265059692545
    m_Localized: Fast. Its bite heals it, so it keeps coming back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123265227464704
    m_Localized: Wind Shaman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123265227464705
    m_Localized: Blows a line of 3 cells and pushes everyone on it, often into other strikes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123265382653952
    m_Localized: Skeleton Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123265382653953
    m_Localized: Elite. Sweeps 3 cells in front of it, and charges from afar to push you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123265550426112
    m_Localized: Lava Golem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5123265550426113
    m_Localized: Elite. Erupts on a cross of cells and leaves them burning. Hurts whoever hits it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570314100088832
    m_Localized: Exhausted
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570314234306560
    m_Localized: Cannot walk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570314477576192
    m_Localized: Sling Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570314477576193
    m_Localized: 'Marks 2 cells in a row, 2 to 4 cells away in a straight line, and slings a stone there on its next turn: 1 damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570314725040128
    m_Localized: Royal Blow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570314725040129
    m_Localized: 'Marks a row of 3 cells in front of him and smashes them with his hammer on his next turn: 2 damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570314951532544
    m_Localized: Magma Fist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570314951532545
    m_Localized: 'Marks a row of 3 cells in front of it and punches them on its next turn: 1 damage and Burning for 2 turns.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570315131887616
    m_Localized: Static Shock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570315131887617
    m_Localized: 'Marks every cell around it and shocks them on its next turn: 1 damage to each.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570315324825600
    m_Localized: Ogre Punch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570315329019904
    m_Localized: 'Marks a row of 3 cells in front of him and punches them on his next turn: 2 damage and pushes 1 cell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570315517763584
    m_Localized: Stone Fist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570315517763585
    m_Localized: 'Marks a row of 3 cells in front of it and punches them on its next turn: 1 damage and pushes 1 cell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570315744256000
    m_Localized: Mud Bolt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570315744256001
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cross of 5 cells 2 to 3 cells away and throws mud at it on its next turn: 1 damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570315932999680
    m_Localized: Charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570315932999681
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cell 2 to 3 cells away in a straight line and charges it on its next turn: 1 damage and pushes 1 cell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570316113354752
    m_Localized: Javelin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570316117549056
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cell 2 to 4 cells away in a straight line and throws a javelin at it on its next turn: 1 damage and pushes 1 cell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570316318875648
    m_Localized: Arc Lightning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570316318875649
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cross of cells 2 to 3 cells away and strikes it with lightning on its next turn: 1 damage to each.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570316516007936
    m_Localized: Sonic Shriek
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570316516007937
    m_Localized: 'Marks every cell around it and shrieks on its next turn: 1 damage to each and pushes everyone 1 cell away.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570316696363008
    m_Localized: Flame Burst
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570316696363009
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cross of cells 2 to 3 cells away and bursts into flames on its next turn: 1 damage and Burning for 2 turns.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570316893495296
    m_Localized: Blinding Gaze
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570316893495297
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cell 2 to 4 cells away in a straight line and glares at it on its next turn: 1 damage, and whoever is there is Blinded (cannot use skills on their next turn).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570317065461760
    m_Localized: Plague Bite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570317065461761
    m_Localized: 'Marks an adjacent cell and bites it on its next turn: 1 damage and Poisoned for 2 turns.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570317237428224
    m_Localized: Quill Burst
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570317237428225
    m_Localized: 'Marks every cell around it and shoots its quills on its next turn: 1 damage to each.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570317405200384
    m_Localized: Acid Spit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570317405200385
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cell 2 to 3 cells away and spits acid at it on its next turn: 1 damage and Exposed (takes 1 more damage from every hit).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570317619109888
    m_Localized: Tornado
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5570317619109889
    m_Localized: 'Marks a cross of cells 2 to 4 cells away and summons a tornado on its next turn: 1 damage and pushes everyone 1 cell away from the center.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5660003393937408
    m_Localized: Charge Drill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5660003473629184
    m_Localized: 'Unlocks Shield Charge: charge up to 3 cells in a straight line. An enemy at the end takes 1 damage and is pushed 1 cell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5660003704315904
    m_Localized: Heavy Shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5660003704315905
    m_Localized: 'Unlocks Shield Bash: slam an adjacent enemy: 2 damage, push it 2 cells and stun it, cancelling its prepared strike.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5660003951779840
    m_Localized: Frost Touch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5660003951779841
    m_Localized: 'Unlocks Frost Nova: freeze everyone around you: 1 damage, and on their next turn they cannot walk or use skills. A frozen enemy loses its prepared strike.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5660004169883648
    m_Localized: Pyromancy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5660004174077952
    m_Localized: 'Unlocks Fireball: hurl a fireball at a cell 2 to 3 cells away: 2 damage, and the cell burns for 2 rounds (1 damage to whoever ends a turn on it).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5660004375404544
    m_Localized: Hunting Hook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5660004379598848
    m_Localized: 'Unlocks Hook: throw a hook at an enemy 2 to 3 cells away in a straight line: 1 damage and pull it up to 3 cells toward you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5660004610285568
    m_Localized: Shadow Path
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5660004610285569
    m_Localized: 'Unlocks Shadow Step: trade places with a character up to 3 cells away; an enemy takes 1 damage. An enemy''s prepared strike moves with it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5670288141918208
    m_Localized: Impact Grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5670288276135936
    m_Localized: 'Throw it up to 3 cells away, in line of sight: pushes every enemy in a 3x3 area 1 cell away from the center. Collisions deal damage. Does not cost your action.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5670288276135937
    m_Localized: Swap Scroll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5670288276135938
    m_Localized: Swap places with a character up to 4 cells away, in line of sight. A strike it prepared moves with it. Does not cost your action.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5670288280330240
    m_Localized: Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5670288280330241
    m_Localized: Raises a rock on an empty cell up to 3 cells away, in line of sight, for 3 rounds. It blocks walking and line of sight. Does not cost your action.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5670288280330242
    m_Localized: Fire Flask
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5670288280330243
    m_Localized: 'Throw it up to 3 cells away, in line of sight: sets a cross of 5 cells on fire for 2 rounds. Fire hurts whoever stands in it. Does not cost your action.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5670288280330244
    m_Localized: Frost Flask
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5670288280330245
    m_Localized: 'Freezes an enemy up to 3 cells away, in line of sight, for 1 turn: it neither walks nor uses skills, and its prepared strike is cancelled. Does not cost your action.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
